{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51160","headline":"自乡[还]（远）虢 · 王勃","name":"自乡[还]（远）虢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（王福畤之子，勔、勮、勃皆有才名，故杜易简称爲三珠树。\n其後助、劼、劝，又皆以文显。\n勃於兄弟之间极友爱，《自乡[还]〖还〗虢》诗云云。\n观此语意，岂兄弟有不相能者耶？\n及观《诫功劲云》：「欲不可纵，争不可常，勿轻小忿，将成大殃。\n」此二人者，似非处於礼义之域者。\n「《棠棣》废」之语，疑爲此二人设也。\n）人生忽如客，骨肉知何常。\n愿及百年内，花萼常相将。\n无使《棠棣》废，取譬人无良。\n（《韵语阳秋》十）（据影宋本《韵语阳秋》校改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}